tasks.description:
Integrate a real-time employee attendance and logged hours tracking feature into the business app, showing total active employees, daily/weekly/monthly logged hours, and check-in statuses at a glance.  &#x20;

Acceptance Criteria:

✅ Display key metrics cards for Total Employees and Logged Hours (Today, This Week, This Month). &#x20;

✅ Update employee check-in and check-out status dynamically in real time.&#x20;

✅ Ensure smooth navigation to detailed employee logs and reporting views.

Integrate interactive Staff Check-in/Check-out tracking section into the business app to allow managers and staff to view status, last updates, and execute manual check-ins/check-outs.  &#x20;

Acceptance Criteria:

✅ Display staff check-in/check-out roster list with employee initials/avatars, name, and last update timestamp.  &#x20;

✅ Provide functional 'Check In' / 'Check Out' action buttons per staff member.  &#x20;

✅ Sync check-in/check-out state in real time across the business app dashboard and attendance logs.

Implement an attendance and hours reporting system accessible via the sidebar navigation to aggregate, filter, and export logged hours data for payroll and staff management. &#x20;

Acceptance Criteria:

✅ Create a dedicated Reports view accessible from the main navigation menu. &#x20;

✅ Provide aggregated time logs filtered by daily, weekly, and monthly timeframes.   ✅ Enable export and detailed breakdown of staff attendance logs.

