Design high-fidelity UI/UX mockups and wireframes for the native AMP Organization module and all its submodules (Manage, Equipment, Inventory, Tags, Vendors, Projects, Departments, Teams, Employment Types, and Recurring Expenses).  &#x20;

Acceptance Criteria:

✅ Create Figma wireframes and high-fidelity screens for the main Organization overview and all 10 submodules.   ✅ Design interactive management tables, creation/edit modals, filter bars, and status badges aligned with AMP design tokens.✅ Ensure seamless layout responsiveness and clear UX patterns across desktop, tablet, and mobile views.

Design high-fidelity UI/UX layouts, wireframes, and management screens for the 'Manage' and 'Equipment' Organization submodules. &#x20;

Acceptance Criteria:

✅ Create wireframes and Figma designs for Organization Manage overview and settings screens. &#x20;

✅ Design Equipment catalog, tracking tables, status badges, and assignment/edit modals. &#x20;

✅ Ensure responsive layouts and adherence to AMP design system components.

Design unified input screens, date pickers, and data tables that seamlessly handle Ethiopian fiscal dates alongside Gregorian dates while enforcing mandatory dimension tags across accounting entries.  &#x20;

Acceptance Criteria:

✅ Design Dual-Calendar Date Picker Component supporting Ethiopian fiscal calendar (Hamle 1 to Sene 30, Pagume merged into Nehase) alongside Gregorian dates. &#x20;

✅ Design Contextual Dimension Tagging Bar for header and line-item dimension inputs (Branch, Department, Cost Center, Project) without cluttering the main transaction view.

✅ Design Multi-Currency Conversion & Tax Bar displaying real-time ETB conversions, gross amounts, withholding taxes, and VAT calculations.

Implement a persistent universal quick action button and modal popup in the main application shell/navigation that allows users to quickly create records across all AMP modules (e.g., New Employee, Run Payroll, New Invoice/Bill, New Voucher, New Service/Package, New Task/Project).  &#x20;

Acceptance Criteria:

✅ Add a prominent Quick Action (+) trigger button to the primary navigation bar/sidebar shell.&#x20;

✅ Build a multi-module "Create Anything" modal popup categorizing fast-action creation triggers across HR, Payroll, Finance/Billing, Organization, POS, and Marketplace modules.&#x20;

✅ Support keyboard shortcut activation (e.g., C or Cmd+Shift+K) and direct routing to creation forms or inline modals.
